{"path":"chemistry/application/stse-culture","title":"STSE 传统文化与化学工业速查","type":"knowledge","html":"<h1>STSE 传统文化与化学工业速查</h1>\n<h2>一、古籍中的化学（考法：古文→反应类型/方程式）</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>古籍典故</th>\n<th>化学本质</th>\n<th>反应/解释</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;曾青得铁则化为铜&quot;（曾青 = 铜盐溶液，如胆矾）</td>\n<td>湿法炼铜（置换）</td>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Fe+CuSO_4=FeSO_4+Cu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Fe</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">CuS</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></spa