">=</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>高温</mtext></mpadded></mover><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Fe_2O_3+3CO\\xlongequal{高温}2Fe+3CO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1563em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3CO</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0063em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.228em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm cjk_fallback mtight\">高温</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.783em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.334em;min-width:0.888em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.334em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 334\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 50 h400000 v40H0z m0 194h40000v40H0z\nM0 50 h400000 v40H0z m0 194h40000v40H0z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2Fe</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）；&quot;煮、蒸&quot;多是<strong>分离提纯</strong>；&quot;金属入溶液得紫红色物质&quot;=<strong>置换</strong>。</p>\n<h2>二、近代化学工业（考法：流程 + 人物）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>侯氏制碱法（联合制碱，1943 侯德榜）</strong>：\n<ul>\n<li>反应：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>↓</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NH_3+CO_2+H_2O+NaCl=NaHCO_3\\downarrow+NH_4Cl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">NaCl</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">NaHC</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↓</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Cl</span></span></span></span></span>（NaHCO₃ 溶解度小析出）；</li>\n<li>顺序：<strong>先通 NH₃ 后通 CO₂</strong>——氨水碱性更强，吸收 CO₂ 更充分（先 CO₂ 后 NH₃ 吸收差、产率低）；</li>\n<li>优点：食盐利用率高、副产品 NH₄Cl 可作氮肥、无 CaCl₂ 废渣（对比索尔维法）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>合成氨</strong>：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">=</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mtext>催化剂</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>高温高压</mtext></mrow></mpadded></mover><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{N_2+3H_2\\xlongequal{催化剂,高温高压}2NH_3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1563em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0063em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.228em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm cjk_fallback mtight\">催化剂</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathrm cjk_fallback mtight\">高温高压</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.783em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.334em;min-width:0.888em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.334em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 334\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 50 h400000 v40H0z m0 194h40000v40H0z\nM0 50 h400000 v40H0z m0 194h40000v40H0z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（哈伯·博施；工业条件 500℃ 左右、20~50 MPa。见 equilibrium-problem-template）。</li>\n<li><strong>青蒿素（屠呦呦，2015 诺贝尔生理学或医学奖）</strong>：\n<ul>\n<li>从青蒿中提取，<strong>低温</strong>、用<strong>乙醚/醇</strong>浸取——青蒿素<strong>热不稳定</strong>、受高温分解，传统&quot;水煎&quot;提不出有效成分；</li>\n<li>结构含<strong>过氧键</strong>（功效来源），分子式 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>15</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{C_{15}H_{22}O_5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">22</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>三、性质 vs 用途（考法：配对找错）</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>物质</th>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>常见错误说法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>明矾（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn>12</mn><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">KAl(SO_4)_2\\cdot12H_2O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>水解生成胶体<strong>吸附</strong></td>\n<td>净水</td>\n<td>❌&quot;明矾能杀菌消毒&quot;（只吸附沉降、无强氧化性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NaOH</td>\n<td>碱性</td>\n<td>制肥皂、除油污</td>\n<td>❌&quot;NaOH 中和胃酸&quot;（腐蚀性，用 NaHCO₃ 或 Al(OH)₃）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NaHCO₃</td>\n<td>受热/遇酸产生 CO₂</td>\n<td>发酵粉、灭火器</td>\n<td>✔ 胃酸过多（碱性弱、温和）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fe₂O₃（铁红）</td>\n<td>红棕</td>\n<td>红色涂料、炼铁原料</td>\n<td>不是&quot;磁性&quot;材料（磁性用 Fe₃O₄）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SO₂</td>\n<td>漂白（生成不稳定无色物）</td>\n<td>纸浆漂白</td>\n<td>❌&quot;SO₂ 能使红色变白 = 氧化漂白&quot;（是<strong>结合</strong>漂白；品红褪色加热复红）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ClO₂</td>\n<td>强氧化性</td>\n<td>自来水消毒</td>\n<td>✔ 消毒剂（取代液氯趋势）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>焰色反应</td>\n<td>元素特征</td>\n<td>K 紫（透过蓝色钴玻璃）</td>\n<td>&quot;焰色&quot;是<strong>物理</strong>变化（电子跃迁），不是化学变化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>例题</h2>\n<h3>例 1（选填）：古文辨识</h3>\n<p><strong>题目</strong>（自编）《梦溪笔谈》记载&quot;信州铅山县有苦泉，…，以水浸之，……其水可为铜&quot;，即为胆铜法。下列说法错误的是：</p>\n<p>A. 该过程利用了 Fe 的还原性</p>\n<p>B. 发生反应 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Fe+CuSO_4=FeSO_4+Cu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Fe</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">CuS</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">FeS</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Cu</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>C. 该法是&quot;湿法炼铜&quot;的雏形</p>\n<p>D. 铜离子得电子被还原成铜单质，但铁在反应中作氧化剂</p>\n<p><strong>标准解法</strong>：</p>\n<p>胆铜法反应：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Fe+CuSO_4=FeSO_4+Cu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span>。Fe 由 0 价升到 +2 价，<strong>失电子、被氧化</strong>（作还原剂）；<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cu^{2+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由 +2 降到 0，<strong>得电子、被还原</strong>。A（Fe 具还原性）、B、C 均对；D 说&quot;铁作氧化剂&quot;——说反了，铁是<strong>还原剂</strong>，故选 D。</p>\n<p><strong>点评</strong>：① 古文题第一步是<strong>把古文翻译成化学语言</strong>：'苦泉'=硫酸铜溶液、'得铁则化为铜'=置换出铜；② 易错点：谁被氧化谁被还原——<strong>失电子 = 被氧化 = 还原剂</strong>，铁进溶液成浅绿色亚铁离子、铜析出成紫红色固体；③ 若问&quot;现象&quot;：铁表面出现红色固体，溶液由蓝色变浅绿色。</p>\n<h3>例 2（选填）：性质与用途</h3>\n<p><strong>题目</strong>（自编）下列说法正确的是：</p>\n<p>A. 明矾可利用其强氧化性对自来水杀菌消毒</p>\n<p>B. 铁红（Fe₂O₃）可作红色涂料</p>\n<p>C. SO₂ 漂白品红溶液，加热后不能恢复红色</p>\n<p>D. 侯氏制碱法中应先通 CO₂ 后通 NH₃</p>\n<p><strong>标准解法</strong>：</p>\n<p>明矾水解生成 Al(OH)₃ 胶体<strong>吸附</strong>杂质沉降，无强氧化性、<strong>不能杀菌</strong>，A 错。</p>\n<p>铁红是红棕色粉末，作红色涂料，B 对。</p>\n<p>SO₂ 漂白是<strong>化合漂白</strong>，生成无色不稳定物质，<strong>加热可复红</strong>（与 Cl₂ 氧化漂白不同），C 错。</p>\n<p>先通 NH₃ 碱性更强、利于吸收 CO₂，再通 CO₂ 生成 NaHCO₃，D 错。</p>\n<p><strong>点评</strong>：①&quot;净水&quot;（明矾）与&quot;杀菌消毒&quot;（ClO₂、漂白粉、O₃）是两条线，考法爱混；② SO₂ 漂白&quot;可逆&quot;、Cl₂ 漂白&quot;不可逆&quot;、活性炭&quot;物理吸附&quot;，三种漂白机理必分清；③ 侯氏流程顺序&quot;先氨后碳&quot;是固定考法。</p>\n<h3>例 3（选填）：化学史与生活判断</h3>\n<p><strong>题目</strong>（自编）下列有关说法错误的是：</p>\n<p>A. 屠呦呦用乙醚低温萃取青蒿素，是因为青蒿素易受热分解</p>\n<p>B. 青铜是铜锡合金，硬度比纯铜大</p>\n<p>C. 侯德榜联合制碱法的副产品 NH₄Cl 可作氮肥</p>\n<p>D. 黑色火药中硝酸钾作还原剂、硫作氧化剂</p>\n<p><strong>标准解法</strong>：</p>\n<p>A 对：青蒿素热不稳定（这是乙醚低温萃取、不用水煎的原因）。</p>\n<p>B 对：合金硬度大于成分金属（熔点通常低于成分金属）。</p>\n<p>C 对：NH₄Cl 含氮、可作氮肥。</p>\n<p>D 错：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>⋯</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{2KNO_3+S+3C\\rightarrow\\cdots}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2KN</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span></span></span></span></span> 中 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{KNO_3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">KN</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中 N 从 +5 降到 0（被还原）——<strong>硝酸钾是氧化剂</strong>；硫从 0 降到 K₂S 中的 -2（也被还原、作氧化剂）；碳升价被氧化、作还原剂。</p>\n<p><strong>点评</strong>：① 火药三成分的氧化还原角色：硝酸钾（氧化剂，氧源）、碳（还原剂）、硫（易点燃）；② &quot;合金：硬度大、熔点低、耐腐蚀&quot;三句话连在一起记；③ 化学史人物-成果配对：侯德榜-联合制碱、屠呦呦-青蒿素、门捷列夫-元素周期表、凯库勒-苯环结构、哈伯-合成氨。</p>\n","standardHtml":null,"evilHtml":null,"meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":["STSE","传统文化","天工开物","侯氏制碱","青蒿素","湿法炼铜","性质用途"],"summary":"STSE 传统文化与化学工业速查 一、古籍中的化学（考法：古文→反应类型/方程式） 古籍典故 化学本质 反应/解释 &quot;曾青得铁则化为铜&quot;（曾青 = 铜盐溶液，如胆矾） 湿法炼铜（置换） F e + C u S O 4 =","fit":[],"updated":"Sat Mar 08 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"chemistry","title":"化学"},{"slug":"application","title":"化学与生活·应用"},{"slug":"stse-culture","title":"STSE 传统文化与化学工业速查"}],"children":[],"siblings":[]}